# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity 工程 .gitignore
# Library/ Temp/ Logs/ 等都是本机可再生的，绝对不能提交
# （本工程的 Library 约 1.9 GB）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Unity 生成目录 ---
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/

# --- 资源 .meta 必须提交，这里只是防止被上面的规则误伤 ---
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# --- IDE / 工程文件 ---
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# --- Unity 崩溃报告 ---
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# --- 打包产物 ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# --- 操作系统 ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
